; Exact lot gains and commodity-swap gains belong to their posting's
; balancing group (#3314, #3258).  Neither $ nor EUR learns fractional
; display precision here.  Different results in the two groups expose
; gains routed to the wrong group; quantity(amount) checks their value
; independently of display rounding.  The last transaction also checks
; that only the residue from a rounded total lot price is dropped.

2025/01/01 Exact lot bases
    Assets:Stock         10 GAL {$2.00} @@ $25.30
    [Budget:Stock]       11 GAL {$2.10} @@ $25.37
    Assets:Offset
    [Budget:Offset]

2025/01/02 Sub-unit swap gains
    Assets:Coins        -10 BTC {100 EUR} @ 2 ETH {50.02 EUR}
    [Budget:Coins]      -10 BTC {100 EUR} @ 2 ETH {49.97 EUR}
    Assets:Coins         20 ETH {50.02 EUR}
    [Budget:Coins]       20 ETH {49.97 EUR}
    Assets:Offset
    [Budget:Offset]

2025/01/03 Rounded total lot price
    [Budget:Fund]      -101 FOO {{$250.50}} @@ $500
    [Budget:Cash]         $500
    [Budget:Offset]

test reg --no-rounding --format '%(account)  %(quantity(amount))\n' Offset
Assets:Offset  -20
Budget:Offset  -23.1
Assets:Offset  -0.4
Budget:Offset  0.6
Budget:Offset  -249.5
end test
